          "text": "Homework help isn't only for the hour after school. Children who stay into the evening, or come in on a Saturday with a project due, can get help whenever they need it, on every shift until we close at 11 pm. Kids who stay late have dinner at 6 pm and an evening snack at 9 pm, so nobody is doing math on an empty stomach."
